### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:NighttimeDrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:Nighttime ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:LowVisibility ;
    ex:hasRoadType ex:CurvedRoad ;
    ex:hasLaneMarking ex:DashedWhiteLine .

ex:EgoVehicle a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isPositionedOn ex:CurvedRoad ;
    ex:hasSpeed ex:ModerateSpeed ;
    ex:hasHeadlights ex:On .

ex:UnidentifiedObject a ex:PotentialObstacle ;
    ex:isPositioned ex:AheadOf ex:EgoVehicle ;
    ex:isPositioned ex:LeftOf ex:EgoVehicle ;
    ex:hasAppearance ex:BrightReflection ;
    ex:hasPossibleType ex:Motorcycle ;
    ex:hasPossibleType ex:Bicycle .

ex:Streetlight1 a ex:Streetlight ;
    ex:isPositioned ex:RightOf ex:EgoVehicle ;
    ex:providesIllumination ex:Limited .

ex:Sidewalk1 a ex:Sidewalk ;
    ex:isPositioned ex:RightOf ex:EgoVehicle ;
    ex:hasPedestrianCount 0 ;
    ex:hasCyclistCount 0 .

ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:EgoVehicle .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:UnidentifiedObject .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:Streetlight1 .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:Sidewalk1 .
```

